<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Dream Craft - TikTok Hindi</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:#08080c;color:#fff;font-family:sans-serif;padding:20px}
.card{background:#11111a;border:1px solid #333;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;margin:10px 0}
button{padding:10px 16px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:#22d3ee;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}
.code{background:#000;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;margin:8px 0;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h2>DreamCraft - TikTok Hindi Shorts</h2>

<div class="card">
<b>SHOT 1 (0-3s) - Rooftop</b>
<div class="code" id="s1">Visual: Rooftop, rain, Neo-Mumbai
Voice Lipsync (Zara whisper): "Ye kya chamak raha hai kachre me?"
BG Sound: Tez baarish + halki thunder</div>
<button onclick="copy('s1')">COPY SHOT 1</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<b>SHOT 2 (3-6s) - HUD</b>
<div class="code" id="s2">Visual: HUD visor closeup, scanning
Voice Lipsync (AI Voice): "Lifeform detected... bachcha hai"
BG Sound: HUD beep + heartbeat</div>
<button onclick="copy('s2')">COPY SHOT 2</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<b>SHOT 3 (6-9s) - Pod</b>
<div class="code" id="s3">Visual: Alien baby pod me
Voice Lipsync (Baby alien cute): "Mumma... ghar jana hai"
BG Sound: Pod hum + baby coo</div>
<button onclick="copy('s3')">COPY SHOT 3</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<b>SHOT 4 (9-12s) - Drones</b>
<div class="code" id="s4">Visual: Police drones red laser
Voice Lipsync (Zara shout): "Chup ho ja, ab tu safe hai!"
BG Sound: Drone whine + tension drums</div>
<button onclick="copy('s4')">COPY SHOT 4</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<b>SHOT 5 (12-15s) - Escape</b>
<div class="code" id="s5">Visual: Zara pod leke bhaag rahi hai, ud rahi hai
Voice Lipsync (Narrator): "Aur nikal padi naye ghar ki talash me"
BG Sound: Thruster ROAR + emotional music</div>
<button onclick="copy('s5')">COPY SHOT 5</button>
</div>

<script>
function copy(id){
 let t=document.getElementById(id).innerText;
 navigator.clipboard.writeText(t);
 alert("Copied: "+id);
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
